overflow-hidden border-b border-white/15 min-h-[68svh]\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-page-hero\"><img data-cstd-page-hero-image=\"true\" alt=\"记录系统决策的夜间技术档案\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-archive/cstd-archive-notebook-v1.webp\"/><div data-cstd-page-hero-overlay=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.96)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.78)_46%,rgba(5,7,9,0.18)_100%)]\"></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-grid=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 [background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.09)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.09)_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:64px_64px]\"></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-material=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\"></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-artifacts=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden\"><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"neon\" class=\"cstd-deep-neon-rig\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-index\">CSTD / 轨迹 09</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-coordinate\">-33.8688 / 151.2093</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-signal\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-neon-lock\">信号已锁定</span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"underworld\" class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-stele\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-kicker\">冥府档案 / 工坊 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-seal\"><i></i><i></i><b>V</b></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-oath\">经试炼，方可归返</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-underworld-cuts\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><div data-cstd-deep-artifact=\"astral\" class=\"cstd-deep-astral-compass\"><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-kicker\">星界旅记 / 判定 017</span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-die\"><i></i><b>20</b><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-route\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"cstd-deep-astral-oath\">选择落笔，旅程成章</span></div></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-content=\"true\" class=\"relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1540px] flex-col justify-end px-5 pb-16 pt-28 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:pb-20\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl\"><p data-cstd-page-hero-eyebrow=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">02 / FIELD NOTES</p><h1 data-cstd-page-hero-title=\"true\" class=\"mt-6 text-balance text-[2.375rem] font-semibold leading-[0.94] tracking-[0] text-white sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl md:leading-[0.9] lg:text-8xl xl:text-[7rem]\">把实现写成可以复用的工程判断。</h1><p data-cstd-page-hero-summary=\"true\" class=\"mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#c3c9cb] md:text-xl md:leading-9\">不是新闻流，也不是工具清单。这里记录真实项目里关于边界、证据、性能、数据、动效与跨学科系统思维的长期笔记。</p></div><div data-cstd-page-hero-scroll=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#748187]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down h-3.5 w-3.5 animate-bounce text-[#f4d431]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg> <!-- -->向下滚动 / 继续查看</div></div></header><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#080a0c]/92 px-5 py-16 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><article class=\"group border-t border-white/15 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"grid gap-7 py-10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[7rem_minmax(0,1fr)_15rem] md:items-center lg:py-14\" href=\"/notes/chemical-engineering-to-software-systems\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 md:block\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">01</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#657278] md:mt-3 md:block\">2026年7月14日</span></div><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\">学习路径<!-- --> / <!-- -->从课程到系统</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-[#f4d431] md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">化工训练如何进入软件系统设计</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#98a3a7] md:text-base\">我在化工里学到的边界、衡算和实验记录，后来怎样影响我做数据、权限、状态和发布。</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#69757a]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock3 lucide-clock-3 h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6h4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->12<!-- --> <!-- -->分钟<span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Systems thinking</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Research</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Engineering</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Learning</span></div></div><figure class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden border border-white/15 bg-black md:order-none\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-note-chemical-engineering-to-software-systems\"><img alt=\"写满系统图的研究笔记\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-75 transition-[transform,opacity] duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-archive/cstd-archive-notebook-v1.webp\"/><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#f4d431] text-black\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></figure></a></article><article class=\"group border-t border-white/15 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"grid gap-7 py-10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[7rem_minmax(0,1fr)_15rem] md:items-center lg:py-14\" href=\"/notes/data-wrangling-as-product-design\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 md:block\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">02</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#657278] md:mt-3 md:block\">2026年7月18日</span></div><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\">数据科学<!-- --> / <!-- -->从课程到系统</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-[#f4d431] md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">数据清洗也是产品设计</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#98a3a7] md:text-base\">数据清洗并不只是分析前的杂活：每个缺失值、日期和主体匹配规则，都会改变产品怎么说话。</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#69757a]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock3 lucide-clock-3 h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6h4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->12<!-- --> <!-- -->分钟<span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Data wrangling</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">R</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Python</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Contracts</span></div></div><figure class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden border border-white/15 bg-black md:order-none\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-note-data-wrangling-as-product-design\"><img alt=\"记录数据血缘的胶片档案\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-75 transition-[transform,opacity] duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-archive/cstd-archive-data-film-v1.webp\"/><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#f4d431] text-black\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></figure></a></article><article class=\"group border-t border-white/15 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"grid gap-7 py-10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[7rem_minmax(0,1fr)_15rem] md:items-center lg:py-14\" href=\"/notes/deterministic-core-ai-edge\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 md:block\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">03</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#657278] md:mt-3 md:block\">2026年8月3日</span></div><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\">产品工程<!-- --> / <!-- -->证据优先的智能系统</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-[#f4d431] md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">AI 放在解释层，公式留在决策层</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#98a3a7] md:text-base\">让 AI 帮忙整理和解释，但把估值公式、现金流、折现和版本决定权留给能测试的代码。</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#69757a]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock3 lucide-clock-3 h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6h4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->12<!-- --> <!-- -->分钟<span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">AI</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">DCF</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Determinism</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Product</span></div></div><figure class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden border border-white/15 bg-black md:order-none\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-note-deterministic-core-ai-edge\"><img alt=\"相互隔离的确定性模块\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-75 transition-[transform,opacity] duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-archive/cstd-archive-cobalt-modules-v1.webp\"/><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#f4d431] text-black\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></figure></a></article><article class=\"group border-t border-white/15 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"grid gap-7 py-10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[7rem_minmax(0,1fr)_15rem] md:items-center lg:py-14\" href=\"/notes/evidence-first-ai-research\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 md:block\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">04</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#657278] md:mt-3 md:block\">2026年8月6日</span></div><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\">AI 系统<!-- --> / <!-- -->证据优先的智能系统</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-[#f4d431] md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">先刷新证据，再让模型说话</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#98a3a7] md:text-base\">公司研究最贵的往往不是 token，而是过期事实、重复任务和说不清来路的结论。</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#69757a]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock3 lucide-clock-3 h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6h4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->13<!-- --> <!-- -->分钟<span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">AI</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Evidence</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Cloudflare</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Workflows</span></div></div><figure class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden border border-white/15 bg-black md:order-none\" style=\"view-transition-name:cstd-note-evidence-first-ai-research\"><img alt=\"有来源约束的数据舱\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover opacity-75 transition-[transform,opacity] duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-universe/cstd-data-vault-v1.webp\"/><span class=\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center bg-[#f4d431] text-black\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></figure></a></article><article class=\"group border-t border-white/15 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"grid gap-7 py-10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[7rem_minmax(0,1fr)_15rem] md:items-center lg:py-14\" href=\"/notes/host-boundaries-in-one-next-deployment\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 md:block\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">05</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#657278] md:mt-3 md:block\">2026年8月8日</span></div><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\">系统架构<!-- --> / <!-- -->把边界写进代码</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-[#f4d431] md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">一个 Next.js 部署，两个真正独立的网站</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#98a3a7] md:text-base\">一个仓库、一次部署，如何让 custard.top 和 RocoDex 仍然像两套真正独立的产品。</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#69757a]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock3 lucide-clock-3 h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6h4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->12<!-- --> <!-- -->分钟<span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Next.js</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Architecture</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Testing</span></div></div><figure class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden border border-white/15 bg-black md:o