 stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></figure></a></article><article class=\"group border-t border-white/15 first:border-t-0\"><a class=\"grid gap-7 py-10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff] md:grid-cols-[7rem_minmax(0,1fr)_15rem] md:items-center lg:py-14\" href=\"/notes/single-canvas-immersive-web\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 md:block\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">08</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#657278] md:mt-3 md:block\">2026年7月22日</span></div><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\">前端体验<!-- --> / <!-- -->动效有预算</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-[#f4d431] md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">沉浸式网站只需要一个三维运行时</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#98a3a7] md:text-base\">想做沉浸式视觉，先把标题、链接和滚动留给网页，再让一个按需画布负责空间感。</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#69757a]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock3 lucide-clock-3 h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6h4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->12<!-- --> <!-- -->分钟<span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Three.js</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Performance</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Accessibility</span><span class=\"border-l border-white/15 pl-3\">Canvas</span></div></div><figure class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden border border-white/15 bg-black md:orde